You merged [Wet-Ink-Corporation/temper#31](https://github.com/Wet-Ink-Corporation/temper/pull/31), which closes #13, so the choice of pilot repositories is recorded in temper. Both PRs from this round are now merged, and I'm not watching any open PRs.

redkiln-rs is still stopped on its failing tests. To move it forward, choose one of the three options in my last message:
1. wait for `build/phase-0-to-1` to go green;
2. adopt now with tests excluded from the gate;
3. have me investigate the two failing tests first.
